&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;148&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;150&quot; data-end=&quot;237&quot;&gt;Define how Graphcore tests complex hardware before it reaches production and the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;239&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;As Principal Board Test Engineer, you will lead advanced manufacturing test strategy for complex Circuit Card Assemblies. You will shape how Graphcore improves defect coverage, diagnostic resolution and production quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;Your work will influence products, test architectures and manufacturing partners. You will define methods, evaluation criteria and technical approaches that help PTD move faster with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;You will design and direct test strategies across optical inspection, X-ray inspection, in-circuit test, boundary scan and functional test. You will turn complex issues into clear decisions for engineering, suppliers and CEM partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;895&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;This is a senior technical role with real ownership. You will set direction, mentor engineers and help Graphcore build stronger test capability for future products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1061&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team and Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1295&quot;&gt;The Product Test and Diagnosis team detects, diagnoses and manages hardware defects across chips, boards and full systems. The team works close to design, manufacturing, silicon, software and systems engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1297&quot; data-end=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;Work moves through hands-on investigation, clear technical judgement and direct ownership. You will be expected to act fast, speak up and take responsibility for test strategy decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1485&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Decisions are shaped by evidence, design intent and manufacturing reality. You will help the team think big, challenge assumptions and raise engineering standards across disciplines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1691&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1693&quot; data-end=&quot;2277&quot;&gt;· Deep expertise in manufacturing test for advanced, high-complexity Circuit Card Assemblies.&lt;br&gt;· Strong knowledge of electronics fundamentals, CCA manufacturing processes and defect mechanisms.&lt;br&gt;· Expertise in JTAG 1149.x boundary scan, iJTAG and embedded or processor-controlled functional test.&lt;br&gt;· Experience architecting, programming and debugging bed-of-nails MDA/ICT and board-level test systems.&lt;br&gt;· Capability to define test methods, evaluation frameworks and technical criteria independently.&lt;br&gt;· Strong influence across engineering disciplines, suppliers and manufacturing partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2279&quot; data-end=&quot;2491&quot;&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. We also welcome engineers returning to the profession after a career break, including through returnship routes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2493&quot; data-end=&quot;2501&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2503&quot; data-end=&quot;3291&quot;&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3293&quot; data-end=&quot;3655&quot;&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
